[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0242","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0242.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0577","title":"SCO OpenServer recon 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 5.0 至 5.0.6 版本中的 recon 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该程序的第一命令行参数传递超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖进程内存空间并执行任意代码，最终获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 5.0 全系列版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码，建议用户升级至最新版本或应用厂商补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0577"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:34.093","remediation":"建议立即迁移至受支持的操作系统（如 Linux 或现代 UNIX 衍生版），因 SCO OpenServer 已于 2013 年停止支持，官方不再提供安全补丁。作为临时缓解措施，可移除 /usr/bin/recon 的 setuid 权限（执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/recon），并将 recon 程序仅授权给受信任的管理员用户执行，限制普通本地用户的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0410.html","http://security-archive.merton.ox.ac.uk/bugtraq-200104/0221.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6289","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20742","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0577.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0577","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0577.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0577.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2gjj-x74c-fh87/GHSA-2gjj-x74c-fh87.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83010/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0577.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0242.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0241","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0241.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0576","title":"SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 lpusers 缓冲区溢出本地提权漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 5.0 至 5.0.6 版本中自带的 lpusers 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119）。lpusers 是用于设置 LP 打印服务作业队列优先级的管理工具，该程序以 setuid 权限运行。由于对 '-u' 命令行参数缺乏长度校验，本地攻击者可构造超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖栈上返回地址，从而在目标系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地提权。攻击条件为本地低权限用户访问目标系统，无需认证。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分为 4.6（中危），影响 SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 及更早版本。公开利用代码已收录于 Exploit-DB（编号 20739），攻击方式为执行 `lpusers -u $(perl -e 'print \"A\" x 700')` 即可触发内存错误。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0576"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33.987","remediation":"立即移除 lpusers 二进制文件的 SUID 权限位，执行 chmod u-s /opt/K/SCO/Unix/5.0.6Ga/usr/lib/lpusers 以阻止本地用户通过该程序获取 root 权限。随后安装 SCO 官方安全补丁（可从 SCO Support 下载对应补丁号），将 lpusers 升级至修复缓冲区溢出后的版本。若无法立即打补丁，建议在 /etc/system 中启用栈保护机制，并通过文件系统 ACL 限制非特权用户对 lpusers 的执行权限。对于仍在运行 SCO OpenServer 5.0.x 的系统，应尽快规划升级至 OpenServer 5.0.7 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0407.html","http://security-archive.merton.ox.ac.uk/bugtraq-200104/0221.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6292","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20739","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0576.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0576","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0576.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0576.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvj2-vpv2-q7wf/GHSA-fvj2-vpv2-q7wf.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83006/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0576.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0241.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0240","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0240.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0575","title":"SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 lpshut 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 的 lpshut 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 lpshut 传递超长的第一个参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取额外的系统权限。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 版本，攻击者需要拥有本地访问权限，利用难度较低，成功利用后可实现权限提升，对系统机密性、完整性和可用性均造成部分影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0575"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33.873","remediation":"建议升级到 SCO OpenServer 5.0.7 或安装 SCO 官方安全补丁（参见 SCO 安全公告 CSSA-2001-SCO.8）。如无法升级，可移除 lpshut 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpshut），限制仅授权管理员可执行，并通过文件系统权限阻止非信任用户访问该二进制文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0404.html","http://security-archive.merton.ox.ac.uk/bugtraq-200104/0221.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6290","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20737","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0575.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0575","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0575.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0575.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5jpm-5xp5-m5wv/GHSA-5jpm-5xp5-m5wv.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83019/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0575.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9861a1bc-ba61-44a0-9276-87941ee3c55e.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0240.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0237","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0237.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0571","title":"Elron IM Anti-Virus 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Elron Internet Manager (IM) Message Inspector 及 Anti-Virus 3.0.4 之前版本的 Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过在请求 URL 中添加 `../` 序列即可绕过路径限制，读取服务器上任意文件（如配置文件、密码文件等）。该漏洞利用难度低，攻击者仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，可能导致敏感信息泄露。厂商已在 3.0.4 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0571"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33.403","remediation":"立即升级 Elron Internet Manager (IM) Message Inspector 及 Anti-Virus 至 3.0.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Web 服务器组件对用户请求路径的输入验证缺陷。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中禁用目录遍历功能，或通过反向代理规则过滤包含 `../` 的 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0382.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98538867727489&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98567864203963&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2519","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2520","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20717","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0571.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0571","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0571.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0571.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j23g-vxj2-8h48/GHSA-j23g-vxj2-8h48.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2520/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0571.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f1778a97-712c-4455-a619-afc5ff0489ca.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0233","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0233.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0564","title":"APC Web/SNMP Management Card Telnet 管理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"APC Web/SNMP Management Card（型号 AP9606）固件 3.0 及更早版本的 Telnet 管理服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。该卡仅支持单个 Telnet 连接，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过反复发送失败的登录尝试，导致 Telnet 服务临时锁定，从而阻止合法管理员进行远程管理。该漏洞影响固件版本低于 310 的 APC AP9606 设备，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0564"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32.607","remediation":"将 APC Web/SNMP Management Card 固件升级到 310 或更高版本（下载地址：ftp://ftp.apcftp.com/hardware/webcard/firmware/sy/v310/install.txt）。如无法立即升级，可在网络边界防火墙限制对设备 23 端口的访问，仅允许受信任管理 IP 连接，并配置较短的锁定超时时间以减少 DoS 影响窗口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0436.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2430","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6199","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20654","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0564.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0564","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0564.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0564.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-95p5-v3v8-7826/GHSA-95p5-v3v8-7826.json","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/routersploit/routersploit/modules/exploits/switch/APC/CVE-2001-0564-pl.py","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0564.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0233.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0243","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0578","title":"SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 lpforms 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"SCO Open Server 5.0.6 的 lpforms 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 lpforms 程序提交特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据，从而获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SCO Open Server 5.0.6 及可能更早版本，攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统。目前已存在公开的利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0578"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22","updated":"2001-08-22","remediation":"建议立即安装 SCO 针对 OpenServer 5.0.6 的 lpforms 缓冲区溢出安全补丁（参见 SCO 安全公告 erg711801）。如无法安装补丁，可移除 lpforms 程序的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/lpforms）以消除提权风险，或限制可登录系统的用户范围为受信任用户。由于 SCO OpenServer 5.0.6 已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的现代操作系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20736","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0578.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0578","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0578.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0578.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-65pg-39m2-53qg/GHSA-65pg-39m2-53qg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82941/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0578.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0243.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0298","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0298.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0635","title":"Red Hat Linux swap 文件权限不当敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 7.1 在安装过程中创建的交换文件（swap file）被设置了不安全的文件权限，导致任何本地用户均可直接读取该交换文件内容。攻击者需首先获得对目标系统的本地访问权限，随后可通过分析交换文件提取敏感信息（如用户密码），进而实现权限提升或横向渗透。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 7.1 操作系统，CVSS v2 评分为 4.6，属于中等危害等级的信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0635"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:40.517","remediation":"立即应用 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2001-058 发布的更新包以修正 swap 文件权限。临时缓解措施：对所有 swap 文件执行 chmod 600 仅允许 root 读写，或在 /etc/fstab 中禁用非必要的 swap 分区挂载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/5564","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-058.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6493","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/721f5647080ad234b0e7db49f4cb7a1a1f72d604/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0635.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0635","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0635.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ffd57c03ae1089460fd6f5c8a0b1d7efb29040a8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0635.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39d8887723797efc1804585dd06585c9fd751226/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-432r-vhq4-vhjx/GHSA-432r-vhq4-vhjx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2001-0635/final.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0635.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2ea7f4c3-b74c-4598-b7a9-cbe40fd975c5.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0298.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0294","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0294.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0570","title":"minicom 本地特权提升漏洞","description":"minicom 1.83.1 及更早版本存在格式字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过多个格式字符串攻击手段获取额外系统权限。该漏洞源于程序处理用户输入时未正确验证格式字符串参数，攻击者可在本地环境中利用此缺陷提升特权，进而完全控制系统。由于该组件常用于串口通信管理，可能导致敏感数据泄露或系统完整性被破坏。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0570"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33.293","remediation":"应立即安装对应 Linux 发行版的安全更新：Red Hat RHSA-2001-067、Caldera CSSA-2001-016.0 或 Immunix OS 的 minicom-1.83.1-1.0.6x_StackGuard 补丁，这些补丁修复了日志文件中 vsprintf 调用的格式字符串漏洞并移除了 setuid 位。如无法立即打补丁，作为临时缓解措施可执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/minicom` 移除 minicom 的 setuid 权限位，阻止本地攻击者利用格式字符串漏洞获取额外特权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99014300904714&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-016.0.txt","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-067.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/181922","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6498","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cee3c6911c8ad3d64d51c6777b91d49c34766f8c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0570.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0570","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0570.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f5111fc7f0351eb7acd97d5a87fa56872d8a50fd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0570.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/905c759ea25c11a59e5c85d4af57ced286cebb3a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-37xh-63cr-2v48/GHSA-37xh-63cr-2v48.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89029/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0570.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c7e8045e-63de-4581-94c5-6d6901e88162.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0294.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0288","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0288.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0567","title":"Digital Creations Zope ZClass 权限映射修改导致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Zope 是一个流行的开源 Web 应用服务器。Digital Creations Zope 2.3.2 及更早版本中存在一个严重的权限提升漏洞。攻击者无需任何权限验证，即可通过修改 ZClass 权限映射来篡改对象的权限设定，并滥用对对象和方法的访问控制。这意味着攻击者可以绕过正常的身份验证机制，提升自身权限，获得对 Zope 应用的更高级别访问控制。漏洞影响 Digital Creations 推出的 Zope 2.3.2 及之前的所有版本。攻击者可以在本地环境下执行任意代码，从而完全控制 Web 应用服务器。成功利用该漏洞后，攻击者能够读取、修改或删除所有资源，破坏系统的完整性和机密性。漏洞的 CVSS 评分为 4.6，攻击复杂性低，且无需任何权限即可利用。Microsoft Azor 等安全团队已发布安全通告，建议所有使用 Zope 的组织立即升级到最新版本，或采取强制权限控制措施。漏洞最初于 2001 年 8 月披露，目前已被确认修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0567"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32.943","remediation":"建议立即升级 Zope 至 2.3.3 或更高版本（官方已在 2.3.3 修复 ZClass 权限映射漏洞）。若无法立即升级，可临时限制本地用户对 ZClass 权限映射的修改权限，或在 Zope 实例前部署反向代理限制本地管理接口访问。建议参考 Debian DSA-055 安全公告应用官方补丁包。升级后需重启 Zope 服务并验证 ZClass 权限映射功能恢复正常。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000407","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-055","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-049.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-065.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2001-05-01/security_alert","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6958","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0567.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0567","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0567.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0567.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/zope_zclass.nasl","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0567.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-055.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-055.data","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0567.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0288.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0263","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0263.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0616","title":"Faust Informatics FreeStyle Chat 4.1 SR2 MS-DOS 设备名拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 4.1 SR2 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可向目标服务器发送包含 MS-DOS 设备名（如 AUX、CON、NUL 等）的特制 HTTP 请求（例如 GET /aux HTTP/1.0），触发服务器在处理这些保留设备名时发生异常，导致服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可实施，影响服务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0616"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:38.403","remediation":"升级 Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 至 4.1 SR3 或更高版本，该版本已修复对 MS-DOS 设备名（如 AUX、CON、NUL）请求的处理逻辑。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置规则，拦截包含 MS-DOS 设备名的 URL 请求（如 /aux、/con、/nul、/prn 等），作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at"