me":"2001/AVE-2001-0262.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0615","title":"Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 服务器 4.1 SR3 之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含特殊构造的路径遍历序列（如 '...' 或 '....' 等变体）的 URL，绕过目录限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需身份认证即可通过网络远程触发，可能导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者只需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可实施攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0615"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-14T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:38.287","remediation":"升级 Faust Informatics Freestyle Chat 服务器至 4.1 SR3 或更高版本，该版本已修复目录遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器或反向代理层配置 URL 过滤规则，拦截包含 `..`、`...`、`....` 等路径遍历序列的请求，并限制应用程序对文件系统目录的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0241.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1841","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2776","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6601","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20882","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0615.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0615","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0615.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0615.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6m6j-2f5r-3rfw/GHSA-6m6j-2f5r-3rfw.json","https://github.com/yingdongucas/inconsistency_detection/blob/ae69c4fdb796e9540716e0fbf8686c5c8d29a42b/dataset/re_data/dirtra_full_dup.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0615.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_1